[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11043.19, "timestamp": "03:04:03", "text": "她很惊讶他们竟然爆炸了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11047.91, "timestamp": "03:04:07", "text": "它们爆炸了，东西也爆炸了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11051.91, "timestamp": "03:04:11", "text": "等等，但当沉浸式体验……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11054.309, "timestamp": "03:04:14", "text": "当新观点兴起时，它正在玩游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11056.95, "timestamp": "03:04:16", "text": "这件事太令人震惊了，简直难以接受。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11069.349, "timestamp": "03:04:29", "text": "嗯，是的，嗯，他们自己，还有所有的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11072.389, "timestamp": "03:04:32", "text": "像你这样忠实的观众每天都在关注着我们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11075.75, "timestamp": "03:04:35", "text": "那些忠实的观众们会来这里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11077.83, "timestamp": "03:04:37", "text": "到每条流。他们简直太棒了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11081.91, "timestamp": "03:04:41", "text": "担心。如果我的主播变了怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11084.55, "timestamp": "03:04:44", "text": "因为新人群的崛起和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11087.91, "timestamp": "03:04:47", "text": "东西，因为她，因为他们变得又大又大"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11092.07, "timestamp": "03:04:52", "text": "大声喊出来，点赞或者像大R一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11093.91, "timestamp": "03:04:53", "text": "如此受欢迎，或者类似这样的东西会是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11097.59, "timestamp": "03:04:57", "text": "发生。但"}]